                <mxCell id="v1-secrets" parent="v1-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#0f172a;dashed=1;dashed=0;" value="Secrets store&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;all sensitive values (D-59);&lt;br&gt;delivered as env vars (D-46)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="80" width="160" x="-110" y="580" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="v1-note" parent="v1-1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontColor=#0f172a;" value="&lt;b&gt;Key decisions shown&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; One deployment per app; one shared PostgreSQL instance, one database per app (D-37, D-45)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Outbox in API, workers, and ingress (D-27, D-37, D-61); at-least-once, no exactly-once promise&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Routing: tenant provider per channel, else default; worker resolves at send time (D-03, D-42, D-55)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Retries: 4 attempts, d&lt;sub&gt;n&lt;/sub&gt; = min(30 s, 1 s x 2&lt;sup&gt;n-1&lt;/sup&gt;), equal jitter, same provider (D-10, D-15, D-18)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Statuses: PROCESSING, SENT, DELIVERED, BOUNCED, NOT DELIVERED, FAILED (D-26, D-29)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Content and recipients encrypted at app level until the provider call (D-63)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; No identity provider for now: API keys only (D-47, D-51 to D-53)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Open: timeouts (OQ-16); provider-dependent items (OQ-11, OQ-14, OQ-23)" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="180" width="760" x="-110" y="980" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
